(please Cc)

I am running linux with kernel with one of the latest git checkouts
(2 days ago or so).

Today while pausing playing a DVD from a external btrfs USB disk
I got a hard crash which interestingly mentiones both ext3 journal
and btrfs_commit_transcation.

Don't ask me to reproduce that, but I thought I send that bug report
with a photo of the Ooops. Hope that helps.

(Debian/sid)

